Cell["\<\
In fact the joint distribution is the product of two single-mode squeezed \
vacua since there are no correlations\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0021284031710014`*^9, 
  4.002128417179184*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2f544dae-3f1c-bc4e-a0e4-\
946a42d95df9"],

Cell["\<\
We can clearly see that in the decomposition that the beam splitter was not \
doing anything:\
\>", "Text",
