Cell["\<\
The Bloch\[Dash]Messiah form is the same network for any input, while the GBS \
form is only valid for vacuum. With one photon in each of the first two modes:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.0021298510456295`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"d1ec1cde-de2f-8542-aa9e-\
557f1f55cdcb"],

