Cell["\<\
The hafnian of the full six-mode network reduces to the permanent because B \
is bipartite between herald and signal modes.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0023677580711765`*^9, 
  4.002367761514166*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a8df0b6e-7338-ff41-ba0a-\
ea60a9db1154"],

Cell["\<\
In the experiment the herald pattern is not chosen,  it changes from shot to \
shot. Sampled shots, signal modes 1\[Dash]3 first and heralds 4\[Dash]6 after\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.002367795737301*^9, 4.002367804545439*^9}, 
   4.0023682805756226`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"39af8017-b794-f74f-8049-\
3a32525a9cbe"],

