}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
For the 100\[Times]100 hafnians of a Jiuzhang-sized pattern, researchers \
estimated about a month and a half on a supercomputer. Better classical \
algorithms, exploiting loss, collisions and the structure of the experiments, \
can help move the boundary for quantum advantage.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0023914005852547`*^9, 4.002391425187855*^9}, {
  4.002392046063238*^9, 
  4.002392064311737*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e3d900d0-f8b7-a74a-b7cf-\
ed7f8543e65b"]
}, Open  ]],

